  "class_data_items": "All map-declared physical class_data items are bounded and validated (delta/index/group flags/body/implicit owner); nonempty item owner must have a class_def. Offsets referenced by class_defs must be exact physical item starts. Empty orphans and nonempty orphans with an existing owner are accepted; unreferenced items do not silently add logical class_fields/class_methods. SDK37 positive/negative evidence retained.",
